"+_ln+" has LEFT the party and is no longer travelling with the player. Do not narrate them as present in the current scene or acting alongside the party; the conversation history above may still show them present, but they have gone. They remain part of the world and may reappear later as an ordinary NPC if the story brings them back.

";}

